# Data Models & Config — Rules

## Модели данных (dataclasses, src/models.py)

Все сущности — `@dataclass`. Не использовать dict/tuple для передачи результатов между этапами.

### ColorResult
```python
@dataclass
class ColorResult:
    name: str           # "white", "black", "gray", "silver", "red", "blue"
    confidence: float   # 0.0 - 1.0
    method: str         # "hsv" or "kmeans"
    rgb: tuple          # (R, G, B) dominant color values
```

### DetectionResult
```python
@dataclass
class DetectionResult:
    bbox: tuple               # (x, y, w, h)
    color_hsv: ColorResult
    color_kmeans: ColorResult
    primary_color: str        # Final color after comparison
    size_category: str        # "small" | "medium" | "large" | "long_thin"
    area_pixels: int
    aspect_ratio: float
    contour: np.ndarray
```

### Decision
```python
@dataclass
class Decision:
    category: str       # "Зарядка iPhone", "Кабель питания", "Unknown (Mouse)"
    confidence: float   # 0.0 - 1.0
    color: str
    size: str
    method_used: str    # "hsv" | "kmeans" | "combined"
    is_unknown: bool    # True if confidence < 0.40
    closest_match: str
    timestamp: str      # ISO 8601
```

### PipelineResult
```python
@dataclass
class PipelineResult:
    original: np.ndarray
    enhanced: np.ndarray
    mask: np.ndarray
    cleaned_mask: np.ndarray
    detection: DetectionResult
    decision: Decision
    processing_time_ms: float
```

